<table role="presentation" width="520" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:520px;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #ECEDF1;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden">
<tr><td style="background:#0E6B6A;color:#FFFFFF;padding:18px 24px;font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,'Noto Sans Sinhala','Iskoola Pota','Nirmala UI',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:18px">Sathiya</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px;color:#14213D">
<div style="font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,'Noto Sans Sinhala','Iskoola Pota','Nirmala UI',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6"><p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Hello,</p><p style="margin:0 0 12px;">We got a request to reset the password for your Sathiya account. Use the button below to choose a new one.</p><table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 4px"><tr><td style="background:#0E6B6A;border-radius:10px"><a href="https://app.example.test/auth/action?mode=resetPassword&amp;oobCode=abc" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:15px">Reset password</a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#5A6378">If you didn&#39;t ask for this, you can ignore this email. Your password stays the same.</p></div>
<div style="border-top:1px solid #ECEDF1;margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px;color:#3B4560"><div style="font-family:'Noto Sans Sinhala','Iskoola Pota','Nirmala UI',Inter,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6"><p style="margin:0 0 12px;">ආයුබෝවන්,</p><p style="margin:0 0 12px;">ඔබගේ Sathiya ගිණුමේ මුරපදය යළි සැකසීමට ඉල්ලීමක් ලැබුණි. නව මුරපදයක් තෝරා ගැනීමට ඉහත බොත්තම ඔබන්න.</p></div></div>
</td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0;padding:16px 24px 0;text-align:center;font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,'Noto Sans Sinhala','Iskoola Pota','Nirmala UI',sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#8A91A3">Sathiya: free school timetables for Sri Lanka · <a href="https://www.example.test/" style="color:#8A91A3">www.example.test</a></p>
</td></tr></table>
</body></html>",
  "subject": "ඔබගේ මුරපදය යළි සකසන්න · Reset your Sathiya password",
  "text": "Hello,

We got a request to reset the password for your Sathiya account. Use the button below to choose a new one.

Reset password: https://app.example.test/auth/action?mode=resetPassword&oobCode=abc

If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email. Your password stays the same.

---

ආයුබෝවන්,

ඔබගේ Sathiya ගිණුමේ මුරපදය යළි සැකසීමට ඉල්ලීමක් ලැබුණි. නව මුරපදයක් තෝරා ගැනීමට ඉහත බොත්තම ඔබන්න.

--
Sathiya: free school timetables for Sri Lanka
https://www.example.test/",
}
`;

